/-
  Nock/NockVMROM/Thm54/VclL/Handle/AcceptsJ9V.lean

  `AcceptsJ9V`: the verifier's acceptance predicate for the J-9 (big-atom) claim.  It is `AcceptsJ8V` with these
  differences (every other conjunct is the same):
  * `hsatX` at `ClaimJ9.pubVJ9` (the claim label carries the third arm `atom n ≥ p ↦ (2, idx)`);
  * `hsumC'` over `ClaimJ9.claimRecsJ9 = claimRecsJ8 ++` the big-leaf records `claimVec (E (atom n)) idx 0 0`;
  * `hclA` (claim atoms `< p`) is absent;
  * `hclI` also covers the big-atom positions;
  * `hcen` → `hcen'`: the census nouns `ClaimJ9.censusGJ9 = censusG ++` the claim's big atoms, with leaf limb length
    `lenL v ≤ nA + 2` in place of `v < p`.
-/
